    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">This blackberry spread is a blackberry lovers must. By adding less sugar the flavor of the berries is forward rather than a mouth-full of sweetener. Use liberally on toast, waffles, ice cream or in a smoothie. Enjoy responsibly.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ingredients:  Organic Blackberries, Organic Sugar, Fruit Pectin, Calcium Citrate.</span></p>",
